    "created_at": "2016-07-07T22:49:59Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-07-07T22:49:59Z",
    "body": "Thank you for finding this! Much appreciated.\n\n> Aside: the duplication of labour y'all have going on between the two specs is a tragic waste of good people's time and makes me sad.\n\nYeah. As we say [in the introduction](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/introduction.html#is-this-html5?), \"Although we have asked them to stop doing so, the W3C also republishes some parts of this specification as separate documents.\" I agree it's very sad and a waste of a lot of peoples' time; see e.g. the comical https://github.com/w3c/html/issues/364.\n",
